From: kristofferR <481270+kristofferR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ao_spatial: render TrueHD Atmos and DTS:X with SpatialAudioBridge

The output owns its Swift renderer, synchronizer and audio-session settings.
SpatialAudioBridge is compiled from pinned sources by mpv-build. There is no
application callback, raw-address option or installed spatial-audio header.
A refused stream latches its format and reopens for mpv's PCM decode path.
Volume changes and end-of-stream reach the renderer through private functions.

